Well, I still had a problem - after ascension :-).  I am playing using
an ASCII window, but under Windows XP you cannot just cut and paste
from this as under Linux.  So what I did in order not to lose the
information was to use a grab utility to get bitmaps of the windows -
there were 33 in total.  I then used an optical character recognition
system (actually, I tried out three different ones) to extract the
textual information.  Had to do some editing afterwards, because not
all letters came out correctly.  In particular, all "r"s had turned
into "y"s, so I replaced all "y"s by "r"s and then edited the "r"s
that actually had to be "y"s by hand.  The most funny monster name I
got was "Cyey-elues".


